OL,4,CPope Francis' diary reveals claims he  
OL,5,Csaw the devil three times              
OL,6,GPope Francis claimed he saw the devil  
OL,7,Gthree times over the course of his     
OL,8,Glife, as well as the "gates of hell",  
OL,9,Gaccording to new extracts from his     
OL,10,Gprivate diary.                         
OL,12,FIn The Private Diary of Pope Francis,  
OL,13,Fpublished on Tuesday, a 2021 entry     
OL,14,Flists the late pontiff as having three 
OL,15,Fvisions of the devil: once from a car, 
OL,16,Fanother "in the choir loft" during     
OL,17,FMass, and a third during a meeting     
OL,18,Fwith Vatican officials.                
OL,20,F"I can't forget the powerful raspiness 
OL,21,Fof his voice," Francis wrote,          
OL,22,Frecalling one of the visions.          
